        "Content": "• Exceptional four-bedroom semi-detached A2-rated family home\r\n• Situated within the exclusive Bolton Park development of just 21 homes, built in recent years\r\n• No onward chain\r\n• Presented in superb turnkey condition throughout\r\n• Bright, spacious accommodation designed for modern family living\r\n• Magnificent open-plan kitchen, dining and family room\r\n• Bespoke contemporary kitchen with quartz worktops, large central island and premium integrated appliances\r\n• Four well-proportioned bedrooms with fitted wardrobes\r\n• Extremely impressive 10ft ceilings at ground level\r\n• Newly fitted solar panels\r\n• Air to water heat pump\r\n• Triple-glazed windows\r\n• Beautifully landscaped rear garden with generous patio area\r\n• Mature landscaped communal grounds and private residents' playground\r\n• Within walking distance of Rathfarnham Village, Marlay Park, St. Enda's Park and Rathfarnham Castle Park\r\n• Excellent transport links including the M50 (Junction 12), the Luas Green Line and numerous Dublin Bus routes"
